2026-07-29T04:43:40.1867300Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-07-29T04:43:40.1867490Z +     "\n",
2026-07-29T04:43:40.1868060Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
2026-07-29T04:43:40.1868680Z +     "that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.\n",
2026-07-29T04:43:40.1869060Z +     "\n",
2026-07-29T04:43:40.1869450Z +     "To run the test suite locally, set the environment variable before checking:\n",
